From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: misc-de <misc-de@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 13:05:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] po: The cast quick setting

Translations of the cast quick setting (0019) and its desktop button
(0113, the buttons per TV) for de, es, fr, it, nl, pl, pt, pt_BR (as pt) and ru: the tile
was shown in English in every language so far. Kept apart so that the
plugin patches stay free of po hunks.
---
